## Copy Engine

NVIDIA QUADRO DUAL COPY ENGINES

COPY ENGINE AND A METHOD FOR DATA MOVEMENT

CPU将应用Space的数据Copy到driver space并转换，之后下载到GPU VRAM组成overlap。

